["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">患者</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんじゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">患者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"161653\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあなたの<ruby>第一号<rp>(</rp><rt>だいいちごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>患者<rp>(</rp><rt>かんじゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になるわ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我会成为你的第一个病人</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">勘定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">计算；计数；核算；账单；账目；结账；付款；体谅；照顾；考虑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183982\"><ruby>勘定<rp>(</rp><rt>かんじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>合計<rp>(</rp><rt>ごうけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>５００ドルになる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">帐单为500美元。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">感情</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">感情</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">情</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">感じる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんじる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">感受；感觉；体验；感动；打动；感染；反应；染上（疾病）；感染</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"159320\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はときどき<ruby>悲<rp>(</rp><rt>かな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しく<ruby>感<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不时地觉得难过。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/884230\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">肝心</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんじん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">至关重要；重要；关键；主要</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198948\">なんであれ<ruby>物事<rp>(</rp><rt>ものごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>本体<rp>(</rp><rt>ほんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>捕<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らえる<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>肝心<rp>(</rp><rt>かんじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不管问题是什么 关键是要深入到事情的核心</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">関する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">涉及；关系到；与…相关</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"87699\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>動物<rp>(</rp><rt>どうぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>関<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她写了一本关于动物的书</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">感ずる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんずる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">感受；感觉；体验；被……感动；被……触动；被……打动；对……有所反应；染上（疾病）；患上</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">完成</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完成；完善；成就</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"145351\"><ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>鉄道<rp>(</rp><rt>てつどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだ<ruby>完成<rp>(</rp><rt>かんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>していない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">新铁路尚未完成。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">歓声</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">欢呼声；欢声；喝彩声</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176691\"><ruby>群集<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐんしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>嬉<rp>(</rp><rt>うれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しさのあまり<ruby>歓声<rp>(</rp><rt>かんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">人群欢乐地大喊。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">間接</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんせつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">间接；间接性</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">幹線</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干线；主干线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">感染</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">感染；传染；被感染；受感染；受影响；被不良思想所感染</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217937\">これらの<ruby>感染<rp>(</rp><rt>かんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>病<rp>(</rp><rt>やまい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はミルクの<ruby>汚染<rp>(</rp><rt>おせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>原因<rp>(</rp><rt>げんいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这些感染是由受污染的牛奶造成的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">関税</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんぜい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">关税；进口税；关税税率</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223891\">このカメラには<ruby>関税<rp>(</rp><rt>かんぜい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がかかります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这相机是应课的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">完全</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんぜん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完美；完全；完整</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183961\"><ruby>完全<rp>(</rp><rt>かんぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>求<rp>(</rp><rt>もと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めるとかえって<ruby>失敗<rp>(</rp><rt>しっぱい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">最好的往往就是好的敌人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">簡素</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんそ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">简朴；朴素；简约</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209672\">その<ruby>式典<rp>(</rp><rt>しきてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>簡素<rp>(</rp><rt>かんそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">仪式很简单</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾燥</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干燥；干旱；烘干；脱水；干燥处理；枯燥乏味；无趣味</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186807\"><ruby>果実<rp>(</rp><rt>かじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>天日<rp>(</rp><rt>てんぴ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>乾燥<rp>(</rp><rt>かんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>させます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">果实在阳光下干涸了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">感想</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんそう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">印象；感受；想法；感想</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225286\">ゲームについてのご<ruby>感想<rp>(</rp><rt>かんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你对比赛有什么感觉?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">観測</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんそく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">观测；观察；测量；见解；预测；推断</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">寒帯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんたい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">寒带</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">簡単</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんたん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">简单；容易；不复杂；简短；简略；简便</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202171\">テニスをすることは<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>簡単<rp>(</rp><rt>かんたん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">打网球对我来说很容易。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/339320\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">勘違い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんちがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">误会；误解；错误的想法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113946\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はクラスで<ruby>一番<rp>(</rp><rt>いちばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>頭<rp>(</rp><rt>あたま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいいと<ruby>勘違<rp>(</rp><rt>かんちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いしている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他幻想自己是班里最聪明的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">官庁</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんちょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">政府机构；政府部门；官方机关</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">缶詰</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんづめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">罐头食品；罐装食品；禁闭某人（如使其专心工作等）；被困在狭小空间内</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194642\">メグはトマトの<ruby>缶詰<rp>(</rp><rt>かんづめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">梅格买了一罐西红柿</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">観点</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんてん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">观点；视点；立场；角度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"105597\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>違<rp>(</rp><rt>ちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った<ruby>観点<rp>(</rp><rt>かんてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るようになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他来见我 在一个不同的光。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾電池</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんでんち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干电池</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184052\"><ruby>乾電池<rp>(</rp><rt>かんでんち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>探<rp>(</rp><rt>さが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しているのですが。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在找电池</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">関東</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">关东（包括东京及周边县的地区）；关东（日本东半部；封建时代）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">監督</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんとく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">监督；管理；监察；指挥；导演；主管；监督人；教练；工头；经理；监察员；主任；上司</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207631\">その<ruby>店<rp>(</rp><rt>みせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>警察<rp>(</rp><rt>けいさつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>監督<rp>(</rp><rt>かんとく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のもとにある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">商店由警方监管。</span></div></li>","<li cla