a\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">考试作弊；夹带作弊</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166187\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはみな<ruby>試験<rp>(</rp><rt>しけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でカンニングをすることは<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いと<ruby>考<rp>(</rp><rt>かんが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们都认为在测试上作弊是错误的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">観念</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんねん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">观念；想法；概念；意识；感觉；认命；接受；有心理准备；禅定；冥想</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194152\">もう<ruby>助<rp>(</rp><rt>たす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からないものと<ruby>観念<rp>(</rp><rt>かんねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我放弃了所有生存的希望</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">看板</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんばん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">招牌；标牌；广告牌；门牌；吸引力；卖点；代表人物；门面；商号声誉；名号；外观；样子；门面；打烊；营业结束时间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"122883\"><ruby>日光<rp>(</rp><rt>にっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>看板<rp>(</rp><rt>かんばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>文字<rp>(</rp><rt>もじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があせた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">太阳已经淡化了标志上的信。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾杯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんぱい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干杯；敬酒；为某人或某事祝酒；干杯；一饮而尽；喝干杯中酒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"171152\"><ruby>今夜<rp>(</rp><rt>こんや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>主賓<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅひん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>乾杯<rp>(</rp><rt>かんぱい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">敬这位贵宾!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">看病</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんびょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">护理患者；照顾病人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"100532\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>病人<rp>(</rp><rt>びょうにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずに<ruby>看病<rp>(</rp><rt>かんびょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他看着病人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">幹部</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">管理层；领导层；干部；高层领导；上层领导</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112371\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>について<ruby>幹部<rp>(</rp><rt>かんぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>何人<rp>(</rp><rt>なんにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かと<ruby>協議<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他就此事与一些工作人员进行了磋商。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">勘弁</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんべん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">原谅；宽恕；容忍</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205796\">それだけは<ruby>勘弁<rp>(</rp><rt>かんべん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我愿意做任何事情,但那个。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">完璧</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんぺき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完美；完善；无缺陷</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222903\">この<ruby>英作文<rp>(</rp><rt>えいさくぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>完璧<rp>(</rp><rt>かんぺき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这篇英语作文离完美还差得远。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/510879\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">冠</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かんむり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">神道教士和廷臣佩戴的传统帽子；王冠；皇冠；冠冕；汉字的冠部首；字头；俳谐的首句；最优的；无与伦比的；第一的；名称；头衔；冠名赞助；（将棋）冠（头衔数的量词）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141545\"><ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>生徒<rp>(</rp><rt>せいと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>冠<rp>(</rp><rt>かんむり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>